et:\nRound of 16:\n- Athletico-PR vs Boca Juniors: 0-3 aggregate -> Boca Juniors\n- Cerro Porteño vs San Lorenzo: 2-1 aggregate -> Cerro Porteño\n- Cruzeiro vs River Plate: 0-0 aggregate -> decided on penalties (not in dataset)\n- Emelec vs Flamengo: 2-2 aggregate -> decided on penalties (not in dataset)\n- Godoy Cruz vs Palmeiras: 2-6 aggregate -> Palmeiras\n- Grêmio vs Libertad: 5-0 aggregate -> Grêmio\n- Internacional vs Nacional (URU): 3-0 aggregate -> Internacional\n- LDU vs Olimpia-PAR: 4-2 aggregate -> LDU\nQuarterfinals:\n- Boca Juniors vs LDU: 3-0 aggregate -> Boca Juniors\n- Cerro Porteño vs River Plate: 1-3 aggregate -> River Plate\n- Flamengo vs Internacional: 3-1 aggregate -> Flamengo\n- Grêmio vs Palmeiras: 2-2 aggregate -> decided on penalties (not in dataset)\nSemifinals:\n- Boca Juniors vs River Plate: 1-2 aggregate -> River Plate\n- Flamengo vs Grêmio: 6-1 aggregate -> Flamengo\nFinal:\n- Flamengo vs River Plate: 2-1 aggregate -> Flamengo\n\n======================================================================\nBrazil players at Brazilian clubs (FIFA data):\n- Atlético-MG: 20 players (avg rating: 73.5, best: Louri Beretta)\n- Grêmio: 20 players (avg rating: 73.3, best: Ronaldo Cabrais)\n- Internacional: 20 players (avg rating: 73.2, best: Gabri Prestão)\n- Cruzeiro: 20 players (avg rating: 72.4, best: Juiano Mestres)\n- Fluminense: 20 players (avg rating: 72.1, best: Laure Santeiro)\n- Botafogo: 20 players (avg rating: 71.3, best: Formosandrinho)\n- Vitória: 20 players (avg rating: 70.4, best: Victildinho)\n- Santos: 20 players (avg rating: 70.2, best: Luimo Boas Santos)\n- Bahia: 20 players (avg rating: 70.1, best: Juli Freitinho)\n- Chapecoense: 20 players (avg rating: 69.8, best: Dani Rochelinhas)\n- Athletico-PR: 20 players (avg rating: 69.6, best: Fred Aníbão)\n- Sport: 20 players (avg rating: 69.4, best: Davi Parrela)\n- Paraná: 20 players (avg rating: 68.7, best: Rafael Cachoira)\n- Ceará: 20 players (avg rating: 67.7, best: Caio Milaçar)\n\n======================================================================\nAmbiguous team name 'atletico'. Candidates: Athletico-PR, Atletico - ES, Atletico Acreano, Atletico Alagoinhas, Atletico Bucaramanga, Atletico Huila, Atletico Madrid, Atlético - AC, Atlético - BA, Atlético Cearense - CE, Atlético Nacional, Atlético Tucumán. Please be more specific.\n\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nfrom brazilian_soccer.data import load_dataset\nfrom brazilian_soccer.server import create_server\nimport asyncio\n\nserver = create_server(load_dataset())\n\nasync def show(name, args):\n    r = await server.call_tool(name, args)\n    print(\"=\" * 70)\n    print(r.content[0].text)\n    print()\n\nasync def main():\n    await show(\"team_stats\", {\"team\": \"Corinthians\", \"competition\": \"Serie A\", \"season\": 2022, \"venue\": \"home\"})\n    await show(\"champion\", {\"competition\": \"Copa do Brasil\", \"season\": 2020})\n    await show(\"head_to_head\", {\"team_a\": \"Palmeiras\", \"team_b\": \"Santos\", \"limit\": 3})\n    await show(\"biggest_wins\", {\"limit\": 3})\n    await show(\"derbies\", {\"season\": 2023, \"limit\": 4})\n    await show(\"bracket\", {\"competition\": \"Libertadores\", \"season\": 2019})\n    await show(\"players_by_club\", {})\n    await show(\"search_matches\", {\"team\": \"atletico\"})\n\nasyncio.run(main())\nEOF","time":{"start":1788275057560,"end":1788275057650}},"id":"prt_05d7fdeaa001weKy3NbIPp1TiI","sessionID":"ses_fa29f8b64ffekf1eHikDs909KG","messageID":"msg_05d7fc5c3001MF02SnJ4lsYaSE"}}
